  <name>AIDEN Desktop</name>
  <summary>AI desktop assistant with code execution, encrypted storage, and LAN mesh</summary>
  <description>
    <p>AIDEN is a powerful AI assistant that runs on your local machine. It provides:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Conversational AI via OpenRouter proxy (or custom providers)</li>
      <li>Sandboxed code execution (Bubblewrap + seccomp)</li>
      <li>Encrypted local conversation storage (AES-256-GCM)</li>
      <li>LAN mesh for distributed response caching between nodes</li>
      <li>Privileged operation via polkit with command whitelist enforcement</li>
      <li>SSH-key authenticated peer discovery</li>
      <li>Image generation, web search, and systemd service management</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Available frontends: GTK, Tauri (Desktop webview), and Textual (Terminal UI).</p>
  </description>
  <categories>
    <category>Utility</category>
    <category>AI</category>
    <category>Chat</category>
  </categories>
